What are Smart Home Camera Robots?
Smart Home Camera Robots are autonomous mobile devices equipped with advanced imaging systems designed for residential security, monitoring, and interaction. These intelligent robots perform navigation and surveillance tasks, including real-time video streaming, motion detection, facial recognition, and two-way communication. They encompass indoor patrol robots, companion assistants, pet monitors, delivery aides, and multifunctional home security solutions that go beyond traditional stationary cameras.
