•	Partnerships with insurance providers and smart home ecosystem players
•	Expansion of clinical research infrastructure, trial networks, and regional distribution alliances
Collectively, these factors are expected to enhance accessibility, stimulate innovation, and drive Smart Home Camera Robots’ penetration across new geographies and applications.
